From 58a2638c7acc7c684fc7e6fca6df3921e93b0d9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 14:17:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: put staff charges back after each home-sell trial

borg_think_home_sell_best() tries each pack item in each home slot.
For a staff or wand it moves one item's share of the charges into the
home slot and takes them off the pack stack, but after the trial it
only put the item count back.  The pack stack therefore lost a share of
its charges on every trial, so later trials in the same scan valued the
staff with too few charges.

With a stack of two Staffs of Teleportation and one scroll in the home,
replacing the scroll was valued with the full charges but adding the
staff beside it with a drained share, so the Borg chose to take the
scroll out of the home instead of storing the staff.  Restore the
charges together with the count.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#132.
---
 src/borg/borg-store-sell.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-store-sell.c b/src/borg/borg-store-sell.c
index 9fcfd53b3..8c1a8f4a6 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-store-sell.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-store-sell.c
@@ -517,6 +517,10 @@ static void borg_think_home_sell_best(int32_t * best_home_power)
             /* put item back into pack */
             item->iqty++;
 
+            /* for wands and staffs put the charges back too */
+            if (item->tval == TV_STAFF || item->tval == TV_WAND)
+                item->pval += charge_each;
+
             /* put the item back in the test array */
             test_item[n] = n;
         }
